=== Configuration ===
Architecture: 36 layers, d=1024, 16 heads (~660M params)
Grassmann rank: r=384 (37.5% of width) ← INCREASED from r=256
Gating: Hybrid (48 head-level + 4 block-level = 52 gates/layer)
Training: 168k iters (100 tokens/param)

KEY COMPARISON:
